ere is a chance that  apple will give it a 100 discount like  they did with the regular m1 mac mini  compared to the old base lower and intel  model but i believe that that was a  small incentive apple added because the  m1 model lost two thunderbolt ports and  it didn't support as many displays  compared to the old intel base mac mini  so because of that i'm sticking to a  1299 base price prediction for the new  m1x mac mini so with all that said here  is my full specs and features list which  is definitely subject to change as more  leaks and rumors continue to come out  but i'm pretty confident in a lot of  these details now if you disagree with  any of my predictions go ahead and let  me know down in the comment section  below but if you enjoyed this video  definitely go ahead and click the circle  above to subscribe for more videos like  this one and definitely check out one of  those two videos right over there thanks  for watching and we'll see you in the  next video  [Music]

